rd.com/\">HealthSafetyBoard.com</a></p> <p>For Facemasks Visit <a href=\"http://workweartoronto.com/\">WorkwearToronto.com</a> our Workwear and Apparel Shop.<br/>Like us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a>, Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a>, Heart us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a>, and add a Comment on <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/\">Pinterest</a>.</p> <p></p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300", "eid": "85e4764"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/complete-vinyl-unwrap-porsche-cayman/", "text": "Prev Previous Complete Unwrap Porsche Cayman"}, "next": {"href": "/full-golf-cart-wrap/", "text": "Next Golf Cart Full Wrap – Automotive Wrap Shop Next"}, "eid": "0144f5b"}]}, {"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500", "eid": "6026500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500", "tag": "p", "eid": "adce94b"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null, "eid": "a36b238"}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "icon": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase", "eid": "e4d3235"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Contents", "eid": "7d98824"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Share This Post", "href": null, "s